  "summary": "The techno-optimist visual language of the millennium turn: chrome blobs, translucent gadgets, iMac colors and bubble type.",
  "description": "Y2K aesthetics bundle the late-90s/early-2000s faith in a bright digital future: iMac G3 translucent plastics, chrome liquid type, smiley electronics, Nokia T9-era futurism, gamer-girl gloss and clip-art optimism. Coined retroactively by internet archivists (CARI), it overlaps McBling (fashion gloss) and Frutiger Aero (its successor's optimism). Its 2018+ revival dominates streaming covers, fashion and vaporwave-adjacent design.",
